Files modified in retro-ipod-spotify-revival (2026), per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):
  - clickwheel/click.c: compile-time pin defines; pause() main loop (approach from
    thehajime's pizero-2026 fork); signal handling; NO_HAPTIC option; UDP to loopback.
  - install/install.sh: display profiles (composite default, st7789); ARMv6 (Pi Zero W);
    go-librespot pinned with SHA256 checks; pins passed to gcc; MPD (LOCAL_MUSIC);
    comitup apt source (COMITUP_SOURCE); writes /etc/spotifypod/install.env.
  - install/bin/select-lcd-fb.sh: no-op without an fbdev config (composite).
  - install/config/config.env.example: redirect URI options.
  - install/systemd/spotifypod.service, spotifypod-portal.service: load install.env.
  - frontend/spotify_manager.py: playback, Now Playing and volume through the active
    source (Spotify or Music on iPod); loads install.env.
  - frontend/view_model.py: Music on iPod menus; Settings -> About and Update Music.
  - frontend/requirements.txt: exact version pins; python-mpd2.
  - docs/README.md, docs/spotify-callback.html: login relay for this repository; the
    relay only forwards to *.local or private-IPv4 hosts.

